# Daily Brand Reputation Boost

Runs every day at 7AM Ho Chi Minh time (set in .github/workflows/daily.yml).

Secrets to add in GitHub (Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions):

| Name | What it is |
|---|---|
| GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON | The whole text of the JSON key file from Google Cloud |
| DRIVE_FOLDER_ID | The ID at the end of your Photo Pool folder's link |
| SHEET_ID | The ID in your fancam Google Sheet's link |
| X_API_KEY / X_API_SECRET | From the X developer portal |
| X_ACCESS_TOKEN / X_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET | From the X developer portal (generate AFTER setting Read and Write) |
| X_USERNAME | Your X handle without @ (optional, makes the link prettier) |
| FB_PAGE_ID / FB_PAGE_TOKEN | Your Facebook Page ID and long-lived Page token |
| TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN / TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID | For the message you paste into the Facebook Group |

Google Sheet columns: A = Date (like 2026-10-24), B = Fancam 1 link, C = Fancam 2 link.